  "title": "Toffee Pumpkin Spice Bread",
  "description": "This moist bread made with pumpkin butter, cinnamon sugar, and topped with toffee bits is an easy-to-bake treat perfect for the fall season.",
  "authors": [
    "Randy the Chef"
  ],
